# recursive interpolation not allowed

Sephetho ngola: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Lenaneo tšobotsi: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), mola-o-mocha.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Sephetho ngola: a, mola-o-mocha.


Lenaneo tšobotsi: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] bulela: Nnete.

